  "title": "Bodiliness",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "69ee680a-d49a-4881-9c68-dda1be29fb58",
      "text": "Bodiliness is the fact that movements of the body, such as blinks, eye movements and head movements, change a perceiver’s relation to a perceived thing, but not to a thing merely thought about.",
